      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1761490000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "AUTHN = who are you?\nAUTHZ = what can you access?\n• Sessions: central server-side state; easier revocation.\n• JWT: signed claims; usually readable, not encrypted.\n• OAuth 2.0 = delegated authorization; OIDC adds identity.\n• Always check resource ownership/tenant access.\n• Hash passwords with a purpose-built password hashing function.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AUTHN = who are you?\nAUTHZ = what can you access?\n• Sessions: central server-side state; easier revocation.\n• JWT: signed claims; usually readable, not encrypted.\n• OAuth 2.0 = delegated authorization; OIDC adds identity.\n• Always check resource ownership/tenant access.\n• Hash passwords with a purpose-built password hashing function.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p5-0027",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 405,
      "width": 790,
      "height": 230,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 351,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 459,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1761490000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "TOKEN / SESSION SAFETY\n• Validate signature, issuer, audience, expiry and relevant claims.\n• Keep access tokens short-lived; design refresh/revocation.\n• Use secure cookie settings and consider CSRF/XSS.\n• Never log tokens, passwords, or session cookies.\n• Rate-limit login/recovery; use least privilege.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TOKEN / SESSION SAFETY\n• Validate signature, issuer, audience, expiry and relevant claims.\n• Keep access tokens short-lived; design refresh/revocation.\n• Use secure cookie settings and consider CSRF/XSS.\n• Never log tokens, passwords, or session cookies.\n• Rate-limit login/recovery; use least privilege.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
