    {
      "id": "p5-0056",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 110,
      "y": 1460,
      "width": 770,
      "height": 190,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 728,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 952,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1761490000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "• Scheduler decides when work is due; worker does the work.\n• Prefer durable jobs over only in-memory timers.\n• Handle duplicate runs, missed runs, overlap and timezone/DST.\n• Use stable run IDs, atomic claims, checkpoints and bounded retries.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Scheduler decides when work is due; worker does the work.\n• Prefer durable jobs over only in-memory timers.\n• Handle duplicate runs, missed runs, overlap and timezone/DST.\n• Use stable run IDs, atomic claims, checkpoints and bounded retries.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "p5-0057",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 930,
      "y": 1460,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 190,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 741,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 969,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1761490000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "OBSERVABILITY\nRecord scheduled time, start/end, duration, status, attempts and errors.\nMake jobs idempotent; define backfill policy and safe replay.\nIf a job has external side effects, retries must not duplicate them.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OBSERVABILITY\nRecord scheduled time, start/end, duration, status, attempts and errors.\nMake jobs idempotent; define backfill policy and safe replay.\nIf a job has external side effects, retries must not duplicate them.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
