      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "WEBHOOKS: low-latency events, but delivery may duplicate, delay or reorder.\nPOLLING: simpler where callbacks are unavailable, but adds request load and delay.\nVerify provider signatures; persist/enqueue durably; return quickly; dedupe event IDs.\nOften combine webhooks with reconciliation polling.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WEBHOOKS: low-latency events, but delivery may duplicate, delay or reorder.\nPOLLING: simpler where callbacks are unavailable, but adds request load and delay.\nVerify provider signatures; persist/enqueue durably; return quickly; dedupe event IDs.\nOften combine webhooks with reconciliation polling.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
