      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "• File bytes bypass the API server, reducing its bandwidth and memory load.\n• Scope URLs to one object/operation and short expiry; treat them as bearer credentials.\n• Use unique keys, least-privilege IAM, encryption and correct CORS.\n• Verify size/type and scan/quarantine before making content available.\n• Store metadata/status in DB; clean abandoned uploads.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• File bytes bypass the API server, reducing its bandwidth and memory load.\n• Scope URLs to one object/operation and short expiry; treat them as bearer credentials.\n• Use unique keys, least-privilege IAM, encryption and correct CORS.\n• Verify size/type and scan/quarantine before making content available.\n• Store metadata/status in DB; clean abandoned uploads.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
